---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import documents from '../../data/documents.json';
import DocLinks from '../../components/DocLinks.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Ffurflen Flynyddol" title_en="Annual Return">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Ffurflen Flynyddol</span><span lang="en">Annual Return</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/the-council/"><span lang="cy">Y Cyngor</span><span lang="en">The Council</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Ffurflen Flynyddol</span><span lang="en">Annual Return</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Ffurflen Flynyddol a Llythyrau Archwilio</span><span lang="en">Annual Return and Audit Letters</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan yn llunio Datganiad Cyfrifon Blynyddol (Annual Governance and Accountability Return — AGAR) bob blwyddyn. Caiff hwn ei archwilio gan archwilwyr allanol (PKF Littlejohn) ac yna ei gyhoeddi.</p>
    <p lang="en">Llansannan Community Council prepares an Annual Governance and Accountability Return (AGAR) each year. This is reviewed by external auditors (PKF Littlejohn) and then published.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Hawl i Archwilio</span><span lang="en">Right to Inspect</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Mae gan drethdalwyr yr hawl i archwilio cyfrifon y cyngor am gyfnod o bum wythnos gwaith bob blwyddyn. Cyhoeddir y cyfnod hwn ar y wefan hon a thrwy hysbysiad cyhoeddus.</p>
    <p lang="en">Electors have the right to inspect the council's accounts for a five working week period each year. This period is published on this website and through public notice.</p>

    <div class="minutes-list">
      <div class="minutes-item">
        <div>
          <strong><span lang="cy">AGAR 2025/26</span><span lang="en">AGAR 2025/26</span></strong>
          <div class="fg-meta"><span lang="cy">Yn cynnwys: Adran 1 (Llywodraethu), Adran 2 (Cyfrifon)</span><span lang="en">Includes: Section 1 (Governance), Section 2 (Accounts)</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-links">
          <span style="font-style:italic;font-size:0.9rem" lang="cy">Ar gael wedi archwiliad</span>
          <span style="font-style:italic;font-size:0.9rem" lang="en">Available after audit</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="minutes-item">
        <div>
          <strong><span lang="cy">AGAR 2024/25</span><span lang="en">AGAR 2024/25</span></strong>
          <div class="fg-meta"><span lang="cy">Wedi'i archwilio</span><span lang="en">Audited</span></div>
        </div>
        <DocLinks doc={documents.annual_return} />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="upload-note" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <p lang="cy">Am fwy o wybodaeth am y broses archwilio, cysylltwch â'r Clerc.</p>
      <p lang="en">For more information about the audit process, please contact the Clerk.</p>
    </div>
    <p>
      <a href="/the-council/clerk/"><span lang="cy">Cysylltu â'r Clerc →</span><span lang="en">Contact the Clerk →</span></a>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      <a href="https://www.pkf-l.com/services/public-sector/local-councils/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" lang="en">PKF Littlejohn →</a>
      <a href="https://www.pkf-l.com/services/public-sector/local-councils/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" lang="cy">PKF Littlejohn →</a>
    </p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
